TITLE:: SPWatch
summary:: a few controls and busses kept in view, each with its last moments
categories:: Libraries>ServerPanel
related:: Classes/SPTree, Classes/SPInspector

DESCRIPTION::
The values link::Classes/SPTree:: shows under its list: a control of a synth (the strong::w:: beside it in the inspector) or a bus (its strong::watch:: button). Each item keeps its last link::#*historySize:: values, drawn as a line. Language only: SPTree asks the server and puts the values in.

code::
w = SPWatch.new;
w.add((kind: \bus, rate: \control, index: 3, name: "lfo"));
w.put(w.items.first[\key], 0.5);
w.items.first[\value];
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
An empty list.

METHOD:: historySize
How many values an item keeps: 150.

METHOD:: keyOf
An item's key.
ARGUMENT:: what
code::(kind: \control, id:, index:):: or code::(kind: \bus, rate:, index:)::.
RETURNS:: a link::Classes/Symbol::

METHOD:: labelOf
An item in words.
ARGUMENT:: item
One of link::#-items::.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: add
Watch something; answers the item it already had when it is watched.
ARGUMENT:: what
code::(kind: \control, id:, index:, name:, def:):: or code::(kind: \bus, rate:, index:, name:)::.

METHOD:: remove
Stop watching.
ARGUMENT:: key
An item's key.

METHOD:: toggle
Watch, or stop.
ARGUMENT:: what
As for link::#-add::.

METHOD:: includes
Whether it is watched.
ARGUMENT:: what
As for link::#-add::.

METHOD:: put
A value arrived for an item.
ARGUMENT:: key
The item's key.
ARGUMENT:: value
The value.

METHOD:: items
The items, in the order they were added.

METHOD:: controls
The watched controls.

METHOD:: busses
The watched busses.

METHOD:: isEmpty
Whether nothing is watched.

METHOD:: size
How many items.
